{
  "_doc": "Chaos agent presets. Each red agent rolls 0-99 once per chaos tick and looks up the first row whose [lo, hi] contains the roll. spread: claim this many nearest cells. cod: chance this agent dies after acting. die: the agent dies (becomes black) without acting. sabotage: the agent dies and takes each neighboring agent with it with probability sabotage_kill. spawn: also place this many new agents at random cells anywhere. Rolls not covered by any row do nothing. freeze: chance per tick a black cell resolves; it becomes an empty NCA cell with probability black_to_nca, otherwise blue. thaw: chance per tick a blue cell becomes an empty NCA cell. retake_red / retake_black: chance per tick the NCA reclaims a red / black cell that touches a living NCA cell. black_resist / nca_resist: chance a black / NCA cell resists an agent spreading into it. counter_seed: chance a failed attack on an empty NCA cell plants a new NCA seed there. every: NCA steps per chaos tick (the Space's default for the slider).",
